The absence of an intervention-label side channel is essential. An output rule $y=3s_E+\tau s_E$ supplied directly with the audit label fits the two values without a motor mechanism. Holding the physical edge cut while changing only that label exposes this invalid comparison. The theorem identifies a typed return dependence beyond unchanged early control, not biological or phenomenal embodiment.

