The new family preserves the projection identity and invariant native zero section. On the safe cube its fibre contraction is at most $3/4$ under common controls and at most $1/2$ when evaluation is inactive. Its next body and world norms are bounded respectively by $15/16$ and $3/4$, including the primitive inputs. The four-state minimality remains valid for this family. For $R=I$, the evaluative direction retains the corrective bound
