These correspond to the provisional readout construction run-level reports emitted as provisional estimator outputs. Their authority status is deliberately narrow: they are meaningful only as preliminary provisional readout construction diagnostic surfaces. They are not root verdicts, not bridge support, not bridge admissibility, and not phenomenality evidence.

\subsection{Intervention and reducibility records}
Two further record schemas are essential and remain unpopulated:
\begin{enumerate}[leftmargin=1.5em]
\item \texttt{\detokenize{bridge_}\allowbreak{}\detokenize{interven}\allowbreak{}\detokenize{tion_}\allowbreak{}\detokenize{profile}}
