\texttt{\detokenize{bridge_}\allowbreak{}\detokenize{evaluati}\allowbreak{}\detokenize{on_}\allowbreak{}\detokenize{unsuppor}\allowbreak{}\detokenize{ted}} & Root evaluation attempted without required comparator/intervention support. \\
