provisional readout construction defines provisional run-level estimator surfaces through six coordinate mapping modules paired with a provisional surface assembler, emitting six bounded run-level coordinate reports. Neither a calibrated bridge gate, nor a bridge comparator suite, nor a bridge intervention harness is realized at this tier.

