intervention specification specifies a bridge intervention harness comprising a formal intervention registry, perturbation executors, matched controls, and delta normalizers targeting the \texttt{\detokenize{bridge_}\allowbreak{}\detokenize{interven}\allowbreak{}\detokenize{tion_}\allowbreak{}\detokenize{profile}} record. Until realized, the bridge remains interventionally incomplete.

