comparator specification specifies the executable comparator suite: a bridge rival executor, an admissible hybrid composer, a penalized bridge-loss evaluator, and a reducibility record emitter targeting \texttt{\detokenize{bridge_}\allowbreak{}\detokenize{reducibi}\allowbreak{}\detokenize{lity_}\allowbreak{}\detokenize{report}}. Until realized, the bridge remains comparator-unsupported.

